%% Literature-review map for research on trustworthy AI systems.
# Trustworthy AI Literature Themes
## Fairness
- Measurement
  - Group and individual metrics
- Mitigation
  - Pre-processing and constraints
## Transparency
- Interpretability
  - Feature attribution
- Documentation
  - Model cards and data sheets
## Safety
- Robustness
  - Distribution shift
- Evaluation
  - Red-team testing
## Governance
- Accountability
  - Human oversight
- Regulation
  - Risk classification
